count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","review_id":"IM8AvWeJOo0-ASH_12_8DQ","date":"2013-07-20T14:25:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9408305883407593,"text_excerpt":"I have been coming here for the great cocktails and bar scene for many years, way before the \"craft cocktail\" scene got soooooo hip. I went again recently and was reminded why this is not a typical hotel bar. It's a place where locals who like a fun bar scene come. The clueless out of towners are a bonus sideshow. My drinking companion and I both had a Swizzle Stick cocktail (so refreshing in the mid summer heat) and then a $5.50 glass of Sauvignon Blanc. So good. We also split a small plate of fried oysters with citrus and fennel salad. It was awesome. Throw in free valet parking and this NOLA boy is coming back soon!"},{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","review_id":"jjFdLP7we5wDH0UDb2MDcA","date":"2010-12-20T00:01:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9301465749740601,"text_excerpt":"i really love this bar on an evening when i'm (semi) dressed up and in the area looking for a libation. it's never incredibly crowded and the bartenders are ridiculously nice. (i've had several who have either thrown in a drink on the house or discounted a huge round of drinks when i've been with friends.) their cocktail menu isn't as varied as several bars around town, but for those of us who don't require pink umbrellas or neon colored booze, it's not a problem. bonus: free valet parking if you order drinks or food and have the bar validate your receipt. this means that you can be a bit more generous to the valet who retrieves your car."},{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","review_id":"T1qeUakY2DRBhMazi0xvFw","date":"2015-05-11T12:53:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9294376373291016,"text_excerpt":"This place was awesome. The bartenders and waitresses are friendly, the patrons are all upstanding, and the environment is small and quaint. I ordered about four different types of drinks, and the ones that were terrible they didn't charge me for. They just simply tried another drink until they knew that I was happy. Great place going back many more times."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","photo_id":"-Yir2mBRch7RwRFPNHnZTA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-Yir2mBRch7RwRFPNHnZTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.949281632900238},{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","photo_id":"J_RvPZ8xgQcvl0tKhHu7kA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/J_RvPZ8xgQcvl0tKhHu7kA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8922046422958374},{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","photo_id":"uVAEsAToIJiA0FafWT_itQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uVAEsAToIJiA0FafWT_itQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8799254298210144},{"business_id":"XhGLpXHdnA481n0aHDdkpQ","photo_id":"7qXusdtgUTIraMwe5NbblA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7qXusdtgUTIraMwe5NbblA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8493870496749878}]},"notebook_case":null}
